Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.73,Title,,0,0,0,,Masked Self-Helper—The Hero of Justice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.73,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs23\pos(218.948,436.6)}Brought to you by: Ko-FI.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.23,0:00:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Please save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Masked Self-Helper—The Hero of Justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.82,0:00:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I was waiting for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the bad guys a beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Punch 'em all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice prevails in the end after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.05,0:00:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you please pull out the Hero of Justice from your 4-D Pocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't. That's so lame...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, I wonder what's so lame about being a fan of  Hero of Justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I'm in a terrible crisis, he always arrives on time and saves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I really really want the Hero of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:01:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a way to create The Hero of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll think how to create the Hero of Justice, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.71,0:01:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's so hopeless!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.59,0:01:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so helpless!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I will stay up and think till the morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! I forgot to do my homework!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.62,0:01:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then finish your homework quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's already too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.25,0:01:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you sure are so helpless. I'll help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really hopeless. There's no time left!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish one more person could help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.68,0:02:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Masked Self-Helper—The Hero of Justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.89,0:02:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Masked Self-Helper?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.35,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, thanks. You're so reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't summon him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do homework. There's not much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.20,0:02:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, it's time for the breakfast. Hurry up or you'll be late for school!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.49,0:02:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Masked Self-Helper for helping me to finish my homework
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.29,0:02:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But just who are you and where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.87,0:02:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better not to ask.\N Now you have to attend the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.29,0:02:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr. Masked Self-Helper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I'm in trouble, please come and save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.38,0:02:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus Masked Self-Helper came to my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.55,0:02:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,NObita, aren't you just over watching the super hero shows?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's so strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.47,0:02:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how did he find out that you're in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he did. He's the Hero of Justice, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm full!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm off to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.57,0:03:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've seen his costume, heard his voice somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mornin', Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be full of energy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.03,0:03:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, actually the Hero of Justice came to my rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.04,0:03:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hero of Justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, are you listening to my lecture?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so spacing out from morning, so go and stand outside your class!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.13,0:03:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've the Masked Self-Helper to help me, he'll come to my rescue in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you brought your umbrella, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I have the Hero of Justice coming to my help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.03,0:03:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the Masked Self-Helper is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming to my rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.12,0:03:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Masked Self-Helper!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But I forgot to bring my own umbrella!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.93,0:04:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Outside has been fully dried. It's playtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the the Masked Self-Helper—The Hero of Justice by my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.35,0:04:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He will come help me whenever I need him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.15,0:04:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.29,0:04:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,For no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're here now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no thrill now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant has gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you please try to not invite trouble, deliberately?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't come to save you all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.76,0:04:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You call your self Hero of Justice? You'd better be responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.11,0:05:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you kick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got Masked Self-Helper by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... He's gone...!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you kick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Masked Self-Helper, please come and save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.50,0:05:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze, Takeshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're out on streets, being violent towards others again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.89,0:05:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking you home with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I wonder who the Masked Self-Helper really is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, do you want to keep the costume you wore in the play?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've figured it all out. The Masked Self-Helper really were the future you, all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:05:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So no wonder why he knows all the troubles you faced today!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The future you, self traveled through time to help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,To help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.93,0:06:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you went to the past now, the past you was saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.81,0:06:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I did self-service?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has been ran out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Masked Self-Helper, right at your service!
